# v0.66.8.0 RC7 portable automated timeline analysis
# included regression/regression-v06680-rc7-portable-auto-analysis.chqscript
# name: Regression - v0.66.8.0 RC7 Portable Automated Timeline Analysis
# category: regression
# purpose: Prove portable current-run timeline analysis, automatic writer disassembly, milestone snapshots, HUD correlation and paced SDL timeline playback on a short deterministic recording.
# regression-version: 0.66.8.0
